{"id":"H4813","lemma":"מִרְיָם","transliteration":"miryam","sayIt":"mir-YAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Miriam","meaning":"A woman of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.15.20;\ndaughter of: Amram (H6019) and Jochebed (H3115);\nsister of: Moses (H4872) and Aaron (H0175)\n§ Miriam = \"rebellion\"\n1) elder sister of Moses and Aaron\n2) a woman of Judah","glosses":["miriam","then miriam","so miriam"],"count":13,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-15","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Miriam","kjv":"And Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"exo-15","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Miriam","kjv":"And Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-12","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Miriam","kjv":"And Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-12","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Miriam","kjv":"and unto Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-12","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Miriam","kjv":"and Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-12","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Miriam","kjv":"Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-12","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Miriam","kjv":"And Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-20","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Miriam","kjv":"and Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":59,"renderings":{"bsb":"Miriam","kjv":"and Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"deu-24","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Miriam","kjv":"unto Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Miriam","kjv":"Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Miriam","kjv":"and Miriam"}},{"chapterId":"mic-6","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Miriam"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Exodus 15:20","note":"Miriam the prophetess, the sister of Aaron, took a tambourine in her hand; and all the women went out after her with tambourines and with dances.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 12:1","note":"Miriam and Aaron spoke against Moses because of the Cushite woman whom he had married; for he had married a Cushite woman.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Deuteronomy 24:9","note":"Remember what Yahweh your God did to Miriam, by the way as you came out of Egypt.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:17","note":"The sons of Ezrah: Jether, Mered, Epher, and Jalon; and she bore Miriam, Shammai, and Ishbah the father of Eshtemoa.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Micah 6:4","note":"For I brought you up out of the land of Egypt, and redeemed you out of the house of bondage. I sent before you Moses, Aaron, and Miriam.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0175","lemma":"אַהֲרֹן","transliteration":"aharon","gloss":"Aaron"},{"id":"H1332","lemma":"בִּתְיָה","transliteration":"bityah","gloss":"Bithiah"},{"id":"H2268","lemma":"חֶ֫בֶר","transliteration":"chever","gloss":"Heber"},{"id":"H3115","lemma":"יוֹכֶ֫בֶד","transliteration":"yokheved","gloss":"Jochebed"},{"id":"H3354","lemma":"יְקוּתִיאֵל","transliteration":"yequtiel","gloss":"Jekuthiel"},{"id":"H3382","lemma":"יֶ֫רֶד","transliteration":"yered","gloss":"Jared"},{"id":"H3431","lemma":"יִשְׁבַּח","transliteration":"yishbach","gloss":"Ishbah"},{"id":"H4778","lemma":"מֶ֫רֶד","transliteration":"mered","gloss":"Mered"}],"senses":[{"id":"H4813H","gloss":"Miriam","relation":"H4813H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}